<div id="ReportingContent" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiContent" data-tchmi-top="0" data-tchmi-left="0" data-tchmi-width="100" data-tchmi-width-unit="%" data-tchmi-min-width="932" data-tchmi-height="1818">
<div id="ReportingHeadline" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-left="32" data-tchmi-top="16" data-tchmi-height="32" data-tchmi-right="16" data-tchmi-text="%l%L_Reporting%/l%" data-tchmi-word-wrap="True">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-class-names" type="application/json">
[
  "headline-2"
]
</script>
</div>
<div id="ReportingContainer" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiContainer" data-tchmi-left="16" data-tchmi-top="64" data-tchmi-right="16" data-tchmi-height="1738">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-class-names" type="application/json">
[
  "background-container"
]
</script>
<div id="ReportingDescription" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="24" data-tchmi-height="72" data-tchmi-right="24">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The extension TcHmiReporting creates PDF reports with the TwinCAT Reporting Server. Create report orders the report <code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">TestReport</code>, the steps on the left show its configuration. Before the first report, install the package <code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">TwinCAT.XAR.ReportingServer</code> and upload the files of step 1.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingSourcesText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="120" data-tchmi-height="96" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">1. Upload the stylesheet</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">Once before the first report: on the Config page, open TcHmiReporting, Custom config, select the runtime <code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">local</code> and upload each file under Upload CSS/JavaScript file. Or use the button below.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingSourcesCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="224" data-tchmi-height="143" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">ReportingSources/
    <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">ReportingStyles.css</span>   // Styles of the report

// Runtime configuration Reporting
&quot;StyleSheets&quot;: [
  { &quot;Location&quot;: <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;ReportingStyles.css&quot;</span> }
]</pre>
</div>
<div id="UploadSourcesButton" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiButton" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="383" data-tchmi-width="160" data-tchmi-height="40" data-tchmi-text="Upload files" data-tchmi-word-wrap="False">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-trigger" type="application/json">
[
  {
    "event": "%ctx%owner::Id|EventRegistrationMode=Resolve%/ctx%.onPressed",
    "actions": [
      {
        "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
        "active": true,
        "symbolExpression": "%ctrl%UploadSourcesState::Text%/ctrl%",
        "value": {
          "objectType": "FunctionExpression",
          "functionExpression": "TcHmi.Functions.ReportingSample.UploadReportingSources('local')"
        },
        "asyncWait": true
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "Upload the files of ReportingSources and show the result"
  }
]
</script>
</div>
<div id="UploadSourcesState" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-left="200" data-tchmi-top="383" data-tchmi-width="264" data-tchmi-height="40" data-tchmi-text="" data-tchmi-word-wrap="True" data-tchmi-text-font-size="14" data-tchmi-text-font-size-unit="px" data-tchmi-text-vertical-alignment="Center">
</div>
<div id="ReportingReportText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="455" data-tchmi-height="48" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">2. Runtime and report</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">The report TestReport of the runtime local defines the content.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingReportCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="511" data-tchmi-height="245" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">&quot;reports&quot;: {
  &quot;TestReport&quot;: {
    &quot;runtime&quot;: <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;local&quot;</span>,
    &quot;config&quot;: &quot;Reporting&quot;,
    &quot;htmlContainers&quot;: { &quot;SVG_Sample&quot;: ... },
    &quot;textFields&quot;: {
      &quot;Project_Name&quot;: ...,
      &quot;Project_Name_with_JS&quot;: ...,
      &quot;Temperature_with_HTML&quot;: ...
    },
    &quot;tables&quot;: { &quot;PlcTable&quot;: ... }
  }
}</pre>
</div>
<div id="ReportingHtmlText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="788" data-tchmi-height="48" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">3. HTML container</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">Static HTML, in this report an SVG image.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingHtmlCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="844" data-tchmi-height="92" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">&quot;SVG_Sample&quot;: {
  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;SVG Sample&quot;,
  &quot;html&quot;: <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;&lt;svg viewBox=\&quot;0 0 542 159\&quot; ...&gt;&quot;</span>
}</pre>
</div>
<div id="ReportingTextText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="968" data-tchmi-height="48" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">4. Text field</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">Shows a symbol, <code style="font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 3px;">{value}</code> is replaced by its value.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingTextCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="1024" data-tchmi-height="160" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">&quot;Project_Name_with_JS&quot;: {
  &quot;symbol&quot;: <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;ADS.PLC1.MAIN._sProjectName&quot;</span>,
  &quot;value&quot;: &quot;&lt;script&gt;...&lt;/script&gt;&quot;
}

// value: a script can change the output
var valueFull = <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;{value}&quot;</span>;
parent.innerHTML = valueFull + &quot; Hello World!&quot;;</pre>
</div>
<div id="ReportingTableText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="1216" data-tchmi-height="48" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">5. Table</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">One row per array element, one column per property.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingTableCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="1272" data-tchmi-height="194" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">&quot;PlcTable&quot;: {
  &quot;symbol&quot;: <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;ADS.PLC1.MAIN._aTableData&quot;</span>,
  &quot;orderBy&quot;: &quot;nId DESC&quot;,
  &quot;columns&quot;: {
    <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;nId&quot;</span>: { &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Id&quot; },
    <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;sName&quot;</span>: { &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Name&quot; },
    <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">&quot;nValue&quot;</span>: { &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Value&quot;, &quot;values&quot;: ... },
    &quot;hmiGeneratedTime&quot;: { &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Time&quot;, ... }
  }
}</pre>
</div>
<div id="ReportingCreateText" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="1498" data-tchmi-height="48" data-tchmi-width="440">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: bold;">6. Create the report from the HMI</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px;">The button orders it, the viewer loads the PDF.</p>
</div>
<div id="ReportingCreateCode" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.System.TcHmiHtmlHost" data-tchmi-left="24" data-tchmi-top="1554" data-tchmi-height="160" data-tchmi-width="440">
<pre style="margin: 0; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 12px 16px; overflow: hidden; background: rgba(30, 36, 48, 1); color: rgba(214, 222, 235, 1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px;">// Create report: onPressed
WriteToSymbol <span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">%s%TcHmiReporting.OrderReport%/s%</span>
    value: &quot;TestReport&quot;

// ReportViewer: trigger
<span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">%s%TcHmiReporting.Diagnostics::reportsInProgress%/s%</span>
    {} and %i%ReportOrdered%/i%:
    File = &quot;/TcHmiReporting/reports/<span style="background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.45); border-radius: 3px;">TestReport.pdf</span>&quot;</pre>
</div>
<div id="CreateReportButton" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiButton" data-tchmi-left="488" data-tchmi-top="120" data-tchmi-width="160" data-tchmi-height="40" data-tchmi-text="Create report" data-tchmi-word-wrap="False">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-trigger" type="application/json">
[
  {
    "event": "%ctx%owner::Id|EventRegistrationMode=Resolve%/ctx%.onPressed",
    "actions": [
      {
        "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
        "active": true,
        "symbolExpression": "%ctrl%ReportViewer::File%/ctrl%",
        "value": {
          "objectType": "StaticValue",
          "valueType": "tchmi:framework#/definitions/Path",
          "value": null
        },
        "asyncWait": true
      },
      {
        "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
        "active": true,
        "symbolExpression": "%i%ReportOrdered%/i%",
        "value": {
          "objectType": "StaticValue",
          "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Boolean",
          "value": true
        },
        "asyncWait": true
      },
      {
        "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
        "active": true,
        "symbolExpression": "%s%TcHmiReporting.OrderReport%/s%",
        "value": {
          "objectType": "StaticValue",
          "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/String",
          "value": "TestReport"
        },
        "asyncWait": true
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "Clear the PDF viewer and order the report"
  }
]
</script>
</div>
<div id="ReportViewer" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiPdfViewer" data-tchmi-left="488" data-tchmi-top="176" data-tchmi-right="24" data-tchmi-bottom="24">
<script data-tchmi-target-attribute="data-tchmi-trigger" type="application/json">
[
  {
    "event": "%s%TcHmiReporting.Diagnostics::reportsInProgress%/s%",
    "actions": [
      {
        "objectType": "Condition",
        "active": true,
        "parts": [
          {
            "if": [
              {
                "compare1": {
                  "objectType": "Symbol",
                  "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Object",
                  "symbolExpression": "%ctx%args[0]%/ctx%"
                },
                "compare2": {
                  "objectType": "StaticValue",
                  "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Object",
                  "value": {}
                },
                "compareOperator": "==",
                "logic": null
              },
              {
                "compare1": {
                  "objectType": "Symbol",
                  "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Boolean",
                  "symbolExpression": "%i%ReportOrdered%/i%"
                },
                "compare2": {
                  "objectType": "StaticValue",
                  "valueType": "tchmi:general#/definitions/Boolean",
                  "value": true
                },
                "compareOperator": "==",
                "logic": "AND"
              }
            ],
            "then": [
              {
                "objectType": "WriteToSymbol",
                "active": true,
                "symbolExpression": "%ctx%owner::File%/ctx%",
                "value": {
                  "objectType": "FunctionExpression",
                  "functionExpression": "TcHmi.Environment.getHostBaseUri() + '/TcHmiReporting/reports/TestReport.pdf?t=' + Date.now()"
                },
                "asyncWait": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "else": []
          }
        ],
        "asyncWait": true
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "Show the report when the ordered report is finished"
  }
]
</script>
</div>
</div>
</div>
